WEBVTT

00:13:28.496 --> 00:13:31.996
the process of playing that little game
of trying to predict the next word,

00:13:32.454 --> 00:13:36.579
these models have to develop
a representation

00:13:36.829 --> 00:13:42.787
and understanding of what is
likely to come next and.

00:13:43.787 --> 00:13:47.496
I think it is maybe not
perfectly accurate,

00:13:47.496 --> 00:13:52.454
but certainly worth considering to say
that intelligence is very near

00:13:52.454 --> 00:13:54.537
the ability to make accurate predictions.

00:13:54.787 --> 00:13:58.162
What's confusing about this is that
there are so many words on

00:13:58.162 --> 00:14:02.996
the Internet which are foolish as
well as the words that are wise.